## Scope note

This map covers the full site as specified in the master brief. Copywriting is not included in the build — every slot marked **OWNER: ANEESA** is content she supplies. Slots marked **DRAFT EXISTS** have wording already drafted from her own discovery notes; she confirms or corrects rather than writing from blank.

Any slot still empty at the agreed content deadline ships as its stated fallback. Fallbacks are designed so that no missing content leaves a visible hole.
